## Goal

`ready_gap` (the lethal solver's best-first ordering) counts toward the gap only attacks that may hit the enemy hero: a Rush unit on its summon turn, which may attack units only (§6.1), still binds a Taunt in `damage_past_taunts` but adds 0 past the Taunts. Done when a fresh Rush unit as the only attacker on a tauntless board (an enemy unit without Taunt stands for it to attack), hero at 10, gives `ready_gap` 10 (today 6); hero-ineligible attacks still bind Taunts; `face_threat` returns what it does today; and `cargo jackioh gate` (smoke) passes.

## Files to touch

